{"content":[{"c":["ARIEL (P",{"c":["erson"],"sourceClass":"lc","t":"span"},")"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Person or thing overcome in a heroic deed by Benaiah, chief of David’s bodyguard (",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.23.20","r":"2Sam.23.20","rawR":"2Sam.23.20","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.23.20","value":"2Sam.23.20"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Sm 23:20"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.11.22","r":"1Chr.11.22","rawR":"1Chr.11.22","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.11.22","value":"1Chr.11.22"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 11:22"},"). It is not clear that the Hebrew word ",{"c":["ariel"],"sourceClass":"hebrew","t":"span"}," is a proper name in these passages. Benaiah may have killed two “lionlike men” of Moab (",{"c":["kjv"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"},") or destroyed two Moabite altar hearths."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. One of the men sent by Ezra to ask Iddo for Levitical priests to accompany the Jewish exiles returning to Jerusalem from Babylon (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.8.16","r":"Ezra.8.16","rawR":"Ezra.8.16","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.8.16","value":"Ezra.8.16"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 8:16"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"ArielPerson","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"2 Sm 23:20","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Sam.23.20","rawQueryValue":"2Sam.23.20","sourceRefExact":"2Sam.23.20"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 11:22","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.11.22","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.11.22","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.11.22"},{"anchorText":"Ezr 8:16","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.8.16","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.8.16","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.8.16"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"031cb01569e404b4b2613d33098b65a7e5ce915cfad007bebb562a12179e38e8","sourceItemName":"ArielPerson","sourceItemOrder":477,"sourceMember":"Articles/A.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"ArielPerson","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Ariel (Person)","title":"Ariel (Person)","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}